    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 45,
     "y": 128.2,
     "text": "Seventy",
     "font": "display",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 119.64,
     "tracking": -0.5
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 200.1,
     "text": "Joe said he did not want a fuss. Maya said he was getting a fuss.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 311.24
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 215.1,
     "text": "Maya won, as she does, and on the second Saturday of December",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 317.42
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 230.1,
     "text": "we all flew down to Florida, put two tables end to end in his",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 293.08
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 245.1,
     "text": "backyard, borrowed every chair on the street, and fed thirty",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 297.57
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 260.1,
     "text": "people.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 36.55
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 282.6,
     "text": "It was seventy-five degrees, which Joe pointed out to everyone",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 308.25
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 297.6,
     "text": "from Wisconsin, several times.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 154.55
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 330.54,
     "text": "The speech",
     "font": "heading",
     "size": 14,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 78.86
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 345.6,
     "text": "Marcus did a speech. It had slides. Some of the slides were",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 286.48
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 360.6,
     "text": "photos of Joe in the seventies with a mustache we had all been",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 307
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 375.6,
     "text": "told was a myth. Joe laughed until he had to sit down, and then",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 312.14
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 390.6,
     "text": "he stood up and did a speech of his own, which was shorter, and",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 315.88
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 405.6,
     "text": "better, and made Ruth cry.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 131.64
    }
   ],
